# The build context carries only what the image builds from. Recordings,
# models, runs and session records under .local are never published, and the
# client bundle, the binary and the virtual environment are produced inside
# the image rather than copied from this machine.
.local/
.git/
.venv/
**/node_modules/
internal/webassets/dist/
analyzer/lab/
**/__pycache__/
*.exe
*.db
